// This repository packages "MJ" — an opinionated review voice for Amplifier.
// It gives an AI assistant three things: a reviewer that pressure-tests ideas,
// a veteran engineer that names long-term costs, and a blade that safely trims
// bloated code and prose — plus the always-on habits and notes that drive them.

digraph mj {
    rankdir=LR
    fontname="Helvetica"
